# radroots_event_index

## Compatibility quarantine

This package is a private, publish-frozen migration input. New integrations
must use the projection and index contracts in `radroots_storage`. First-party
SDK and indexer consumers still require these models while their ordered
migrations are pending. Step 313 removes this package after those consumers
have moved; adding new consumers is forbidden by `RCRV1-DEV-009`.

This is the README for `radroots_event_index`, which provides indexed
manifest and checkpoint models for the `radroots` core libraries.

## Overview

 * manifest and checkpoint value types for indexed event shards;
 * shard identifiers, id ranges, and shard metadata validation helpers;
 * portable model semantics for both `std` and `no_std` builds;
 * optional integration with `serde` for serialization.

